              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abesilisa phakathi kwabantwana baka-Aroni kumelwe bawudle. Kuyakuba yisimiso esiphakade ezizukulwaneni zenu mayelana neminikelo yomlilo kaJehova; oyithintayo uyakuba ngcwele.",
