          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lona ngumnikelo ka-Aroni namadodana akhe okufanele bawulethe kuJehova ngosuku egcotshwa ngalo; okweshumi kwe-efa lempuphu ecolekileyo kube ngumnikelo wokudla waphakade, inxenye yakho ekuseni nenxenye yakho ebusuku.",
