            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisho ku-Aroni nakumadodana akhe, uthi: ‘Nanku umthetho womnikelo wesono: Endaweni lapho kuhlatshelwa khona umnikelo wokushiswa, umnikelo wesono uyakuhlatshelwa phambi kukaJehova; ungcwelengcwele.",
